SUMMARY:[Healthcare & Clinical AI][Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML]
  CHIL 2026 - Submissions due
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference on Health\, Inference\, and Learni
 ng\nWebsite: https://chil.ahli.cc/\nSource URL: https://chil.ahli.cc/subm
 it/call-for-papers/\nLocation: Seattle\, Washington\, USA\nTopics: Health
 care & Clinical AI\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML\, Fairness &
  Responsible AI\, Machine Learning\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-based
 \nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-08-20\nNotes: Official C
 HIL pages list conference dates\, location\, and submission timeline.\nSc
 ope: Machine learning and inference for clinical\, public\, and populatio
 n health. Distinguishing areas include causal inference\, survival analys
 is\, multimodal health data\, generalization across populations\, interpr
 etability\, and clinical evaluation and deployment. Research may emphasiz
 e methods\, practical applications\, or societal impact. Health-focused i
 nference and evaluation remain the common thread across these tracks.\nAd
 ditional topics: Explainability & Interpretability\, Human-AI Interaction
  & Deployment\, Robustness & Safety\, Time Series & Sequential Data\nScop
 e sources (2026): https://chil.ahli.cc/submit/call-for-papers/\nScope las
 t checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://chil.ahli.cc/submit/call-for-papers/
END:VEVENT
